    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.099,
                0.579,
                0.117
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题(本大题总分20分，共计5小题，每题4分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.133,
                0.632,
                0.148
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 点 \\( (-1,2,0) \\) 在平面 \\( x+2y-z+1=0 \\) 上的投影点的坐标为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.078,
                0.174,
                0.849,
                0.237
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 设 \\(z = f(x, y)\\) 在点(1,1)处可微，且 \\(f(1,1) = 1\\)，\\(f_x(1,1) = 2\\)，\\(f_y(1,1) = 3\\)，\\(\\varphi(x) = f[x, f(x, x)]\\)，则 \\(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\varphi^3(x)\\bigg|_{x=1} = \\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.252,
                0.655,
                0.269
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 设  \\( du(x, y) = (3x^{2}y + 8xy^{2})dx + (x^{3} + 8x^{2}y)dy \\) ，则  \\( u(x, y) = \\)  ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.077,
                0.283,
                0.896,
                0.341
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 设  \\( \\Omega \\)  是由 x = 1, z = 0, z = y, y = x 所围成的闭区域，将三重积分  \\( \\iiint_{\\Omega} f(x, y, z) \\, dv \\)  化为积分次序是  \\( z \\to y \\to x \\)  的三次积分为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.357,
                0.5,
                0.389
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5.将函数 \\( f(x)=\\frac{1}{x} \\) 展开成x-3的幂级数为____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.405,
                0.591,
                0.423
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、计算题(本大题总分50分，共计5小题，每题10分)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.437,
                0.631,
                0.471
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 设 \\( f\\left(y + \\frac{1}{x}, z + \\frac{1}{y}\\right) = 0 \\) 确定了函数 \\( z = z(x, y) \\)，其中 \\( f \\) 可微，求 \\( \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}, \\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial y} \\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.489,
                0.472,
                0.505
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 求函数 \\( f(x, y) = x^{2} - 2xy + 5y^{2} - 8y + 1 \\) 的极值.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.522,
                0.877,
                0.559
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 设 L 为连接  \\( (0,0) \\)  和  \\( (3,4) \\)  的直线段， \\( f(x,y) \\)  在 L 上连续，且  \\( f(x,y)=xy+\\int_{L}f(x,y)\\mathrm{d}s \\) ，求  \\( f(x,y) \\) .",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.079,
                0.572,
                0.918,
                0.628
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 计算  \\( \\oiint_{\\Sigma} 3xy dy dz + yz dz dx - x^{2}y^{4}dx dy \\) ，其中  \\( \\Sigma \\)  是以点  \\( (0,0,0) \\) 、 \\( (1,0,0) \\) 、 \\( (0,1,0) \\) 、 \\( (0,0,1) \\)  为顶点的四面体表面的外侧.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.648,
                0.375,
                0.691
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5.求幂级数 \\(\\sum_{n = 1}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^{n + 1}}{n}\\) 的收敛域及和函数",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.711,
                0.417,
                0.729
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "四、证明题(本题10分，共计1小题)"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.08,
                0.744,
                0.307,
                0.76
